{"ID":"20240118151151-o3guhs6","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151151-o3guhs6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151151-o3guhs6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151151-6c803pe\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122124010-11vjn1r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122124010-11vjn1r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:152,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:152\u0026#125;","title":"166蠡实","type":"doc","updated":"20240131154223"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151151-6c803pe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151151-6c803pe","updated":"20240122123957"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，平，无毒。治皮肤寒热，胃中热气。风寒湿痹。坚筋骨，令人嗜食。久服轻身。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122124000-vzkdubb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122124000-vzkdubb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国陕西河南一带多有之，为山野自生之宿根草，实入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122124001-c473cly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122124001-c473cly"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘，性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122124002-fum96ff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122124002-fum96ff"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】止心烦满，利大小便，长肌肤肥大。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122124004-x7b7zjs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122124004-x7b7zjs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏敬】疗金疮血内流，痈肿有效。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122124005-n7wb8ow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122124005-n7wb8ow"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】妇人血气烦闷，产后血晕，并经脉不止，崩中带下，消一切疮疖，止鼻衄吐血，通小肠，消酒毒，治黄病，杀蕈毒，傅蛇虫咬。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122124007-92pnz2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122124007-92pnz2w"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122124009-pfdzdyx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122124009-pfdzdyx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】不详。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122124009-t8joh0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122124009-t8joh0w"}},{"ID":"20240122124009-zvrlzq6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122124009-zvrlzq6"}},{"ID":"20240122124009-dtf3i4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122124009-dtf3i4f"}},{"ID":"20240122124010-11vjn1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122124010-11vjn1r","updated":"20240131154223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那接着我们继续看下去，这第166味这个药呢，这叫蠡实，现在我们人用得不多，有的是药房可能还没得卖。现在有的人不认识了，一般这个药过去呢按照记载上都是伤科，受伤伤科的时候用，所以伤科啊像内伤啊内部出血啊，刀伤啊，都可以。因为受伤了以后你人会有发烧的现像，因为伤口发炎嘛，有的时候忽冷忽热，所以它也治疗寒热。那一般我们感冒的寒热不会用到蠡实，受伤的寒热我们会用会用到蠡实。那这种剂量呢1钱3钱看第24个人的体格的大小来决定。"}]}]}